@startuml
autonumber
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
title S-03 Requirements + e2e use cases (analyst)

participant "harness\nprimary lead" as primary
participant "harness-analyst" as analyst
participant "local-rag\nFTS5 + LanceDB" as rag
participant "docs/analysis" as docs
participant "harness-orchestrator" as orch

primary -> analyst : task: requirements + e2e for the topic
analyst -> rag : rag_context / rag_search
rag --> analyst : pointers: file + lines
analyst -> analyst : Read and verify sources
analyst -> docs : requirements-*.md\nR-001.., NFR-1..
analyst -> docs : questions-*.md\nopen questions + assumptions
analyst -> docs : glossary.md
analyst -> docs : e2e-use-cases-*.md\nUC-E2E-NNN + coverage matrix
analyst -> docs : e2e-test-data-*.yaml\nschema harness-e2e/1
analyst -> analyst : validate IDs and coverage\n(requirement -> UC-E2E -> data)
analyst --> orch : requirements, e2e artifacts,\nrisks, blockers
note right of analyst
  Every functional requirement is covered
  by a use case or explicitly out_of_scope;
  dataset contains no secrets
end note
@enduml
